{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "int0000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 虚拟变量与交互项\n\n从 0/1 指示定义进入基准组编码，再分成类别×连续与类别×类别两条交互路径；最后经过支持、目标对比、推断和因果命名检查。\n\n**课程入口：** [[02_Economy/01_Econometrics/10_虚拟变量.md#1. 虚拟解释变量|连续阅读课程正文]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 3280,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## [[事件指示变量|指示变量]]\n\n事件或类别成员关系被编码为 0/1；这是概率论与回归共用的同一个数学对象。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## [[多元回归系数]]\n\n系数先描述控制已含变量后的偏线性关系；因果资格需要另外论证。",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[满列秩与OLS唯一性|Full rank and OLS uniqueness]]\nFull column rank makes the entire OLS coefficient vector unique. With rank deficiency, the fitted vector and some estimable contrasts can still be unique.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[满列秩与OLS唯一性]]\n满列秩保证整套OLS系数唯一；秩亏时，拟合向量与某些可估对比仍可唯一确定。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多重共线性|Multicollinearity]]\n\nAn intercept plus all mutually exclusive, exhaustive category indicators is exactly dependent. Near dependence requires a separate precision assessment using the design and error covariance.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[多重共线性]]\n\n截距加互斥、穷尽的全套类别指示列必然精确依赖；近似依赖的精度影响还须结合设计与误差协方差。",
      "x": 1440,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[指示变量系数|Indicator coefficients]]\nSubstitute both group codes at common controls. In a correct additive conditional-mean model, the coefficient is the group mean gap; a fitted approximation gives a fitted gap.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[指示变量系数]]\n固定控制值，分别代入两组编码。正确的加性条件均值模型给实际组均值差；拟合近似给拟合差。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多类别指示编码|Reference-group coding]]\nAn intercept and m−1 indicators express m group levels. Omitting an indicator retains that group’s observations. Check that groups are observed and the whole design has full rank.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[多类别指示编码]]\n截距与m−1条指示列表达m组水平；省略指示列不删除该组观察，仍须检查各组出现与全设计满秩。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[基准组重编码|Changing the reference group]]\nRecode the same complete model on the same data. Unconstrained OLS keeps its fitted values and the same estimable contrasts. A different coefficient row may test a different question.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[基准组重编码]]\n同一数据上重编码同一完整模型，无约束OLS保持拟合值与同一可估对比；不同系数行可能检验不同问题。",
      "x": 1920,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[类别连续交互|Group-specific lines]]\nWith an intercept, X, D and XD, each group can have its own intercept and slope. At fixed x, compare the complete lines.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[类别连续交互]]\n同时保留截距、X、D与XD，允许两组各有截距和斜率。在固定x处比较完整直线。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[交互主效应基准|Reference values]]\nA lower-order coefficient describes a comparison at the other predictor’s reference setting. An ANOVA main-effect test may ask a different question.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[交互主效应基准]]\n低阶系数描述另一变量在参照状态下的比较；ANOVA主效应检验可能问不同问题。",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[交互层级原则|Hierarchy]]\nOmitting D forces equal intercepts at X=0; omitting X forces a flat reference-group line. Retain components unless a deliberate constraint is justified.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[交互层级原则]]\n删D强制两组在X=0截距相等；删X强制基准组斜率为零。通常保留组成项，明确依据可支持受限模型。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[类别类别交互|Two categorical predictors]]\nIn a saturated linear 2×2 model, the interaction is the difference between two group gaps. It uses four cell means and changes sign if one coding is reversed. A causal DID interpretation needs additional assumptions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[类别类别交互]]\n线性饱和 2×2 模型的交互系数是两个组间差距之差，涉及四格均值；反转一个编码会变号。因果 DID 解读另需识别假设。",
      "x": 1920,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## [[取值依赖边际效应]]\n\n平方项或交互让完整斜率随其他变量取值改变，不能只读一行系数。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1310,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000014",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[中心化共线性边界|Centring an interaction model]]\n\nKeep the intercept, main effects and interaction. Shifting origins then changes reference effects while preserving unconstrained OLS fits.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n保留截距、主效应与交互项后，移动原点只换解释基准；不会补出缺失的信息或共同支持。",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 1310,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000015",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[线性组合推断|Inference for a fixed contrast]]\nAt a prespecified covariate value, a group gap or slope can be a fixed coefficient combination. Use the full covariance matrix, including cross terms, then calibrate its interval. Data-selected contrasts require further inference work.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[线性组合推断]]\n在预先指定的协变量值处，组差或斜率可写成固定系数组合。用含交叉项的完整协方差，再校准区间；看数据后选出的对比须另行处理推断。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 1310,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000016",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[交互稀疏支持|Sparse cells and overlap]]\nAn empty sample cell prevents its unrestricted four-cell contrast from being estimated. Small cells affect precision; non-overlapping observed ranges require extrapolation for some comparisons. These are distinct limitations.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[交互稀疏支持]]\n样本空格使相应的无约束四格对比无法估计；小格影响精度，观察范围不重叠使某些比较依赖外推。三者是不同限制。",
      "x": 1920,
      "y": 1310,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000017",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## [[2×2 DID回归等价]]\n\n处理组×处理后是四格差异之差的特殊参数化；回归等价不等于因果识别。",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 1310,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000018",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## [[交互解释流程]]\n\n定义编码与支持 → 重建完整预测 → 构造目标对比 → 传播不确定性 → 最后命名结论。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 1640,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000019",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[条件均值因果边界|Conditional means and causality]]\nConsistency, conditional mean exchangeability and positivity give one sufficient route from observed conditional means to causal means. A regression contrast needs a justified identification argument.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[条件均值因果边界]]\n一致性、条件均值交换性与正值性提供一条充分识别路径。回归中的组差需要另行论证因果识别。",
      "x": 1440,
      "y": 1640,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000020",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## [[概率交互效应]]\n\n二元结果时，在概率尺度重新计算四格预测对比或交叉偏导。",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 1640,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000021",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## [[交互系数不等于概率交互]]\n\nLogit/Probit 指数里的乘积项系数通常不是概率尺度交互效应。",
      "x": 2880,
      "y": 1640,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "int0000000000022",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 下一入口：[[二元结果模型.canvas|二元结果模型]]\n\n同样的 0/1 若出现在等号左侧，研究对象便从类别对比转为事件概率；交互也必须回到概率尺度解释。",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 1970,
      "width": 880,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
